use testing

rem Small limits exercise the counting
rem weights and prime-set parameters.
test "small inputs"
  use "268_fourprimes" as solve
  Answer = solve 100000 30

  Answer equal 3705
  Answer = solve 1000000 30

  Answer equal 37268
  Answer = solve 1000000000000 30

  Answer equal 37351446090
  Answer = solve 1000000 50 3

  Answer equal 210062
end
